    <string name="consent_title">Consent</string>
    <string name="consent_body">You choose what to record. Your entries stay encrypted on this phone, and are sent to the Khai study server only if your coordinator gives you a server address. You can erase everything at any time. No name, address, Aadhaar number or contact list is collected. You may withdraw by erasing your data.</string>
